<title>UK: UBS sets $200 million December 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>UBS sets $200 million December 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UBS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  UBS</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.952   PAY DATE  S-07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.852    SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG/SWS   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND TWO-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED DEBT</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>	     **US/UK/NETH ANTIL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
